# BondX BX-fdc77ff24d - NBO XB gate
# I2 ... O3' [0 0 0]
# CAUTION: ORCA has no built-in NBO. The NBO keyword calls NBO 7, a licensed program.
# Set the NBOEXE environment variable to the NBO 7 executable before running ORCA.
# Without NBO 7 the SCF runs but no NBO analysis is printed.
# The ORCA + NBO 7 route is not tested in this version of BondX.
! wB97X-D3 def2-TZVP RIJCOSX def2/J TightSCF NBO
%pal nprocs 40 end
%maxcore 937

* xyz 0 1
I       0.000000     0.393005     0.000000
F      -0.657366     2.223959     0.000000
O       0.818063    -2.050427     0.000000
C       0.014970    -2.949000     0.000000
H      -1.067503    -2.751850     0.000000
H       0.349471    -3.995649     0.000000
*
